:"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104831","id":2765835215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k20vP","user":{"login":"hiugiak","id":22273250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjczMjUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22273250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak","html_url":"https://github.com/hiugiak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T10:37:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T10:37:21Z","body":"> We disable exceptions in general so I'd say you should just enable them manually if you use an extension that uses them, but would be good to track this further\r\n\r\nYeah, but I'm developing an extension, and some dependencies requires exception enabled, which exports the __cpp_exception symbol, and causes a LinkError when the main module doesn't export this symbol. I think it would be good if the main module keep the __cpp_exception exported, giving the extensions more selections.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765835215/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765838014","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104831#issuecomment-2765838014","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104831","id":2765838014,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k21a-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T10:38:48Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T10:38:48Z","body":"What if you just build with `disable_exceptions=No`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765838014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765847782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104831#issuecomment-2765847782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104831","id":2765847782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k23zm","user":{"login":"hiugiak","id":22273250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjczMjUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22273250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak","html_url":"https://github.com/hiugiak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T10:43:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T10:43:49Z","body":"> What if you just build with `disable_exceptions=No`\r\n\r\nThat doesn't work. The link error occurred in the [WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/WebAssembly/Reference/JavaScript_interface/instantiateStreaming_static#importobject) function. As the doc says,\r\n\r\n> There must be one matching property for each declared import of the compiled module or else a [WebAssembly.LinkError](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/WebAssembly/Reference/JavaScript_interface/LinkError) is thrown.\r\n\r\nwhen the `importObject` doesn't have a property `__cpp_exception`, then a `LinkError` is thrown.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765847782/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765850087","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104831#issuecomment-2765850087","issue_url":"h